      "title": "Audit write failure ratio (5m)",
      "description": "failures / total, with a clamp_min(0.001) on the denominator mirroring the vmmd_cold_boot_ratio recording-rule precedent at faas.rules.yml:1147-1161 (protects against divide-by-zero). Threshold bands: green < 0.001, yellow 0.001-0.01, red >= 0.01. Same units the FaasAuditWriteFailuresSpike alert threshold uses.",
